## Overview

This document summarizes key terms for MedSync's standard vendor agreements. Terms vary based on vendor tier, data access, and service criticality.

---

## Vendor Tiers

### Tier Classification

| Tier | Criteria | Agreement Type |
|------|----------|----------------|
| Tier 1 | PHI access, critical systems | Full MSA + BAA |
| Tier 2 | PII access, business critical | Full MSA, optional BAA |
| Tier 3 | Internal data, moderate access | Standard agreement |
| Tier 4 | No sensitive data | Purchase order |

### Agreement Requirements by Tier

| Requirement | T1 | T2 | T3 | T4 |
|-------------|----|----|----|----|
| Master Services Agreement | Required | Required | Required | Optional |
| Business Associate Agreement | Required | If PHI | N/A | N/A |
| Security Assessment | Full | Standard | Basic | N/A |
| Insurance Certificate | Required | Required | Preferred | N/A |
| Background Checks | Required | Required | N/A | N/A |
| SLA | Required | Required | Optional | N/A |

