## Data Protection

### Data Ownership

| Data Type | Owner |
|-----------|-------|
| MedSync Data | MedSync |
| Customer Data | MedSync (for customers) |
| Aggregated Data | Per agreement |
| Vendor Data | Vendor |

### Data Use Restrictions

Vendor may NOT:
- Use data for own purposes
- Share with third parties (without approval)
- Retain after termination
- Sell or monetize data
- Process outside scope

### Data Location

| Tier | Requirement |
|------|-------------|
| Tier 1 | US only (or specified) |
| Tier 2 | US preferred |
| Tier 3 | No restriction |

### Data Deletion

| Trigger | Timeline |
|---------|----------|
| Termination | 30 days |
| Written Request | 30 days |
| Certification | Upon request |

