- Technical data
- Customer information
- Pricing terms
- Strategic plans

### Obligations

| Obligation | Standard |
|------------|----------|
| Protection | Reasonable measures |
| Use | Only for services |
| Disclosure | Need-to-know |
| Duration | 5 years (perpetual for trade secrets) |
| Return | Upon termination |

### Exceptions

| Exception | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| Public | Already public |
| Prior Knowledge | Known before disclosure |
| Independent | Independently developed |
